											"__type" : "textStyle"
										},
										"string" : "`containerFiles` on a sourced entity is derived from its source anchor, so setting `sourceAnchor:` fills \"Container Files\" and enables the Source tab. `FAMIXFile entities` is the other direction and needs an explicit `addEntity:`"
									},
									{
										"__type" : "textSnippet",
										"children" : {
											"__type" : "snippets",
